          "text": "Urinary symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Nocturia 2–3 times and mild hesitancy; no dysuria, fever, urinary retention, or haematuria."
      }
    },
    {
