        "id": "observation-19",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Mobility and functional limitations"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Mobilises independently without gait aids; occasionally leans on furniture when pain is bad; no recent falls. Difficulty climbing two flights of stairs, especially with groceries; difficulty standing to cook more than 10–15 minutes and walking more than 100 m without rest. Independent with showering, dressing and toileting, though sometimes needs to rest afterward."
      }
